# What Prettier must not touch. This file is the whole of the format gate's
# scope: a path is formatted unless it is excluded here or Prettier has no
# parser for it (Rust, shell and TOML need no entry).

# --- Generated or vendored -------------------------------------------------

node_modules/
target/
# What a package of the npm workspace builds into its own dist/.
dist/
# npm writes this file and its formatting is npm's own.
package-lock.json
# ESLint writes the lint ratchet's baseline (`npm run lint:baseline`,
# `npm run lint:prune`) in its own formatting, and rewrites it on every prune.
/eslint-suppressions.json
# Copier writes the answers file on every render and update, in its own
# formatting.
.copier-answers.yml
# The environment uv builds for the ci project.
.venv/
# Scratch work, which nobody formats.
/tmp/

# --- Prose -----------------------------------------------------------------

# Markdown style is markdownlint's.
*.md
*.mdx
